'' RUN: a value inside a GENERIC procedure may take the name of a type with members -- a
'' local, a local in a nested block, a parameter, instantiated or not. fbc refuses each in an
'' ordinary procedure (tests/diagnostics/class-value-names.test) and accepts all of them here;
'' tiko gave TKO0777. Found through fb/select.bi's 'dim as T ptr sink' inside namespace FB,
'' refused once fb/logging.bi had declared FB.Sink -- in that include order only. Output
'' identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/generic-local-class-name.bas -o tests/codegen/genericlocalclassname.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/genericlocalclassname.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/genericlocalclassname.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: drop true
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: param true
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: nested 3
